# Glats Ghostty theme — monochrome palette
#
# Deployed to ~/.config/ghostty/themes/glats by
# hosts/t14/home/omarchy.nix. This is a ghostty `include` file
# referenced by `theme = glats` (or `theme = extended:glats`).
#
# Use:
#   ghostty -l themes/glats   # ad-hoc
#   # In your ghostty config:
#   theme = glats
#
# Glats palette (monochrome, accent-only):
#   bg          #000000
#   fg          #dddddd
#   accent      #0d73cc
#   selection   #505050
#   dim         #8a8a8a

